\subsection{Overview}
The GR--Hydrodynamics engine is validated using a comprehensive,
multi-domain Verification \& Validation (V\&V) suite spanning
relativistic hydrodynamics, spacetime evolution, GRHD coupling,
black hole thermodynamics, and gravitational-wave radiation.
Each test is benchmarked against analytic solutions, invariant
quantities, or well-established reference results. Numerical
accuracy is quantified using $L_1$, $L_2$, and $L_\infty$ norms,
as well as multi-grid self-convergence ratios.

